---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — TextKit AI"
  description="Terms for using TextKit AI: free tools are provided as-is, Pro subscriptions renew automatically and can be cancelled anytime, and AI scores are probabilistic estimates, not proof."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Last updated: September 22, 2026</p>

  <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">1. The service</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm">TextKit AI provides online text tools, including an AI content detector, a text humanizer, and utilities. Free tools have daily usage limits. A Pro subscription removes limits for its duration.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">2. Scores are estimates, not proof</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm">AI detection and "human-ness" scores are probabilistic estimates. They can misjudge both human and AI text. You agree not to use them as sole evidence for accusations, academic penalties, or employment decisions.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">3. Subscriptions</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm">Pro is $4.99/month or $39/year, billed automatically through our merchant of record until cancelled. You can cancel anytime; access continues until the end of the paid period. Refunds within 7 days of a charge are granted on request.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">4. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm">Don't use the service for illegal purposes, to misrepresent authorship where the law or your institution prohibits it, or to attack the service itself. We may suspend accounts that abuse the service.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">5. No warranty</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm">The service is provided "as is". We're not liable for outcomes of decisions made based on tool output. Always review rewritten text before use.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">6. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm"><a href="mailto:support@textkitai.com" class="text-emerald-700 underline">support@textkitai.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
